{"title":"1998 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is one-half of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/f/40f701e8755a8568226a462a678b1268dc4c54a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2 \\times 10^{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50c5e649372f9402e9109084c2e5275d9cc9212f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 6.0 \\times 10^{30} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 6.0 \\times 10^{29} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 0.6 \\times 5^{30} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1.2 \\times 10^{15} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1.2 \\times 5^{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"713\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a20b72f7aee0c6391654464c25f02280a02cfc72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b + c} = a^{b} \\times a^{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b36ae408b9e2b8fe14928c7790d8c37b819b0a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.2}{2} = 0.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43d08166d13b98d8734b6c1cc197ed7770eb456b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.2 \\times 10^{30}}{2} = \\frac{1.2}{2} \\times 10^{30} = 0.6 \\times 10^{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"291\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b67a6e073be1ffa27b5ba3d9d3105e20ed32d34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=0.6 \\times 10^{29 + 1} = 0.6 \\times 10^{1} \\times 10^{29} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 6.0 \\times 10^{29}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"413\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191901\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1463/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32667:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191901 and revision id 251868. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}